## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to reason about cross-tenant telemetry, privacy, and quota controls for a common data-export workflow.

## Key Concepts
- OTCA telemetry routing in multi-tenant contexts
- Event types around export lifecycles and quotas
- Data sanitization and per-tenant residency
- Schema evolution and dashboard readiness

## Code Example
```javascript
function redactPII(record){
  const r = {...record};
  if(r.user_id) r.user_id = hash(r.user_id);
  if(r.email) delete r.email;
  return r;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate per-tenant quota enforcement in bursts?
- What schema changes would you anticipate as features evolve?

